he table. Check whether racks and pushers are included or sold separately.</p></section><section><h2>Tile size and readability</h2><p>Choose tiles with legible markings and a comfortable weight. Compare dimensions before purchasing; larger tiles may need a larger table.</p></section><section><h2>Budget for the annual card</h2><p>A beautiful tile set is not a replacement for the current annual hand card. Budget for the reference material used by your playing group.</p></section><section><h2>Where to buy</h2><p>You can compare independent retailers and official products, but always verify specifications, shipping and return terms. My Mahjong Era does not currently operate a store or claim retailer affiliation.</p></section><aside>Independent educational guide. We are not affiliated with the National Mah Jongg League or any Mahjong retailer. Check current official rules and product specifications.</aside><p><a href="/american-mahjong/">← Explore more American Mahjong guides</a></p></main><footer>© {new Date().getFullYear()} My Mahjong Era</footer></body></html>